              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "卡片点击热区覆盖整行或整卡；危险操作与普通保存分开。",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$cn-font",
              "fontSize": 14
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "nobIn",
              "name": "规则",
              "fill": "$cn-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "系统导航安全区由设备Insets决定，画稿中的手势条仅为示意。",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$cn-font",
              "fontSize": 14
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "j0GPYE",
              "name": "规则",
              "fill": "$cn-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "日历中间日期用浅蓝连续底色，起止日期用深蓝；同一天只显示一个端点。",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$cn-font",
              "fontSize": 14
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "h1Psn",
              "name": "规则",
              "fill": "$cn-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "页面内容不因固定底部按钮而被遮挡；大字体下页头可随正文滚动。",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$cn-font",
              "fontSize": 14
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "K7tZnp",
              "name": "规则",
              "fill": "$cn-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "本轮不增加消息、订单、社区或个人中心，不为了国内风格塞入额外功能。",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$cn-font",
              "fontSize": 14
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
